/-!
# Native cocycle of crossing pair gluing along the actual whole restart

The receipt-wide crossing decomposition and the actual pair read/write split
refer to the same pair occurrence.  Their combination identifies the forced
causal trace without an observer change:

```text
pair trace at time
  = complete outgoing gluing at time
      - complete outgoing gluing at the written terminal state.
```

The terminal gluing row then continues across the actual whole restart:

```text
terminal gluing at round i
  = source-self presentation change from i to i+1
      + initial gluing at round i+1.
```

Thus an aggregation-kernel component cannot disappear at the quotient.  It
is written into the same-receipt gluing variation, the source presentation
change generated by the next crossing, or the next crossing's gluing keep.
The physical update throughout is the existing actual unforced whole restart.
No uniform quantum, cutoff, target state, branch choice, faithfulness law or
SU7 terminal disposition is used.
-/

